================================================================================
Cryptography notice
================================================================================

This distribution contains cryptographic functionality: optional detached
Ed25519 signatures over ledger events and snapshots, and SHA-256 hashing for
content-addressed identity and the ledger hash chain. These use the Go standard
library (crypto/ed25519, crypto/sha256) only — no third-party or custom
cryptographic implementation is included.

Once the complete corresponding source code is published and freely
available, this software qualifies as publicly available encryption source
code under U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR) License Exception TSU
(15 CFR 740.13(e)). Redistributors are responsible for their own compliance in
their jurisdiction.
